# Release handoff

This compact screen exercises the complete widget model. Use **Tab** to move
between controls; arrows choose a channel, **Enter** confirms it, and
**Ctrl+Enter** leaves the multiline field.

:::radio{id="channel" value="staging"}
::option{value="canary" label="Canary · 5% traffic"}
::option{value="staging" label="Staging · internal verification"}
::option{value="production" label="Production · full rollout"}
:::

::input{id="owner" label="Release owner" value="Ada"}

::textarea{id="notes" label="Release notes" placeholder="Risks, checks, and rollback plan…" rows="3"}

::checkbox{id="approved" label="All pre-flight checks passed"}

::button{id="deploy" label="Queue deployment"}
